  "description": "Zevorsa Vilage has lived its few decades of life peacefully, selling its vegetables and livestock, managed by its caring and kind leader. But to the surprise of the few residents, a group of elite soldiers suddenly visits. Few know the real reason for their arrival, but what they feared most is that their arrival heralded an era of misfortune the continent of Nigde could never hope to experience, thus kicking off this Saga.\n\n_Source: Tapas_",
